{"4729940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roomrush Racer", "steam_appid": 4729940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roomrush Racer is a fast-paced arcade racing game where chaotic races take you through different rooms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >25 Tracks Across 20 Unique Room Worlds</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 27 playable characters and master different speed classes as the challenge continues to increase.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/b897d90e5100253bdcd3cdf8b7c06205.poster.avif?t=1785496010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/b897d90e5100253bdcd3cdf8b7c06205.webm?t=1785496010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/b897d90e5100253bdcd3cdf8b7c06205.mp4?t=1785496010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight turns, hazards, and action-packed item battles make every race fast, varied, and unpredictable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Split-Screen for Up to 4 Players</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 4 players in local split-screen. Compete against each other or work together to win cups.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/503c570b9e60807883f7af7206af570e.poster.avif?t=1785496010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/503c570b9e60807883f7af7206af570e.webm?t=1785496010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/503c570b9e60807883f7af7206af570e.mp4?t=1785496010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect and Combine Items</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect up to 3 items during a race and use a wide variety of power-ups to attack, block, slow down, or disrupt your opponents. In higher speed classes, every decision becomes more important and every race becomes faster and more unpredictable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Own Tracks</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own circuits with the built-in Track Editor. Combine different track pieces, choose a background, track material, and music, and test your track before racing on it.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/8a5e4050e792a96857fb75940678e314.poster.avif?t=1785496010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/8a5e4050e792a96857fb75940678e314.webm?t=1785496010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/8a5e4050e792a96857fb75940678e314.mp4?t=1785496010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share Your Tracks Through the Steam Workshop</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publish completed tracks directly to the Steam Workshop, update your existing creations, and subscribe to tracks made by other players. All tracks created in the Track Editor and downloaded through the Steam Workshop can be played in Versus mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>25 unique tracks</strong> across 20 different rooms<br></li><li><strong>27 playable characters</strong><br></li><li>Fast-paced and accessible arcade racing<br></li><li>Play solo or with up to 4 players in local split-screen<br></li><li>Compete against each other or work together to win cups<br></li><li>Versus, Grand Prix, Time Trial, and Tutorial modes<br></li><li>Multiple speed classes with increasing challenge<br></li><li>Collect up to 3 items at once<br></li><li>A wide variety of items to attack, block, and slow down opponents<br></li><li>Time Trials with ghost racers and global Steam leaderboards<br></li><li>Built-in Track Editor for creating custom circuits<br></li><li>Choose a background, track material, and music for custom tracks<br></li><li>Play all of your custom tracks in Versus mode<br></li><li>Publish and update custom tracks through the Steam Workshop<br></li><li>Subscribe to, download, and play community-created tracks<br></li><li>Choose between Standard Controls and Kid-Friendly Controls with automatic acceleration and steering assist<br></li><li>Keyboard and controller support<br></li><li>Automatic saving</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roomrush Racer is a fast-paced arcade racing game where chaotic races take you through different rooms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >25 Tracks Across 20 Unique Room Worlds</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 27 playable characters and master different speed classes as the challenge continues to increase.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/b897d90e5100253bdcd3cdf8b7c06205.poster.avif?t=1785496010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/b897d90e5100253bdcd3cdf8b7c06205.webm?t=1785496010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/b897d90e5100253bdcd3cdf8b7c06205.mp4?t=1785496010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight turns, hazards, and action-packed item battles make every race fast, varied, and unpredictable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Split-Screen for Up to 4 Players</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 4 players in local split-screen. Compete against each other or work together to win cups.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/503c570b9e60807883f7af7206af570e.poster.avif?t=1785496010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/503c570b9e60807883f7af7206af570e.webm?t=1785496010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/503c570b9e60807883f7af7206af570e.mp4?t=1785496010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect and Combine Items</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect up to 3 items during a race and use a wide variety of power-ups to attack, block, slow down, or disrupt your opponents. In higher speed classes, every decision becomes more important and every race becomes faster and more unpredictable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Own Tracks</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own circuits with the built-in Track Editor. Combine different track pieces, choose a background, track material, and music, and test your track before racing on it.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/8a5e4050e792a96857fb75940678e314.poster.avif?t=1785496010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/8a5e4050e792a96857fb75940678e314.webm?t=1785496010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/extras/8a5e4050e792a96857fb75940678e314.mp4?t=1785496010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share Your Tracks Through the Steam Workshop</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publish completed tracks directly to the Steam Workshop, update your existing creations, and subscribe to tracks made by other players. All tracks created in the Track Editor and downloaded through the Steam Workshop can be played in Versus mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>25 unique tracks</strong> across 20 different rooms<br></li><li><strong>27 playable characters</strong><br></li><li>Fast-paced and accessible arcade racing<br></li><li>Play solo or with up to 4 players in local split-screen<br></li><li>Compete against each other or work together to win cups<br></li><li>Versus, Grand Prix, Time Trial, and Tutorial modes<br></li><li>Multiple speed classes with increasing challenge<br></li><li>Collect up to 3 items at once<br></li><li>A wide variety of items to attack, block, and slow down opponents<br></li><li>Time Trials with ghost racers and global Steam leaderboards<br></li><li>Built-in Track Editor for creating custom circuits<br></li><li>Choose a background, track material, and music for custom tracks<br></li><li>Play all of your custom tracks in Versus mode<br></li><li>Publish and update custom tracks through the Steam Workshop<br></li><li>Subscribe to, download, and play community-created tracks<br></li><li>Choose between Standard Controls and Kid-Friendly Controls with automatic acceleration and steering assist<br></li><li>Keyboard and controller support<br></li><li>Automatic saving</li></ul>", "short_description": "Race across 25 tracks set in 20 chaotic rooms and choose from 27 characters. Play solo or with up to 4 players in local split-screen, collect items, master different speed classes, work together to win cups, and create and share custom tracks through the Steam Workshop.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/23392fdeba7804a2bee152d625e401d32c4b8a8c/header.jpg?t=1785496010", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/cff2b955e8aca2cb1b6548220e8335469de1b671/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785496010", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729940/cff2b955e8aca2cb1b6548220e8335469de1b671/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785496010", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 - 64-Bit (Latest Update).<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1600 or Intel Core i5 6600k<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RX 570 or Nvidia GTX 1050 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 - 64-Bit (Latest Update).<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 2700X or Intel Core i7 6700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RX 5600 XT or Nvidia GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<str